    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1074">

                <pb facs="0914" n="798" xml:id="pg798"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.112H35/2.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at
                            Chihuahua to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Chihuahua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 19, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Full mail report to-day re Heberlein, including his declaration, follows by mail.
                    He was released 10th instant; now in United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Letcher.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
